            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Akorintho 15:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, hunalonda hukumanyiseni mateso hurigophaha ko Asia. Hwagaya sana, kutsapa chiasi cha uwezo wehu wa kuvumirira hata huchikata tamaa ya kpwenderera kuishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli hwadzisikira mwehu mioyoni kala hukaamulwa chifo. Ela higa gahendeka ili husiadamire nguvu zehu, ela huadamire Mlungu ambaye nkufufula atu akufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akahutivya na hatari ya chifo, naye andahutivya, tsona hunakuluphira kukala Mlungu andaenderera kuhutivya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi munahuterya kpwa mavoyo genu. Mana atu anji andamshukuru Mlungu kpwa jinsi ndivyosikira mavoyo genu manji kpwa kuhujaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunahenda ngulu kpwa sababu hunaweza kukuambirani bila kusita-sita kala hwaishi kpwa uaminifu na moyo kutsuka. Naswi hwaahendera hivyo atu osi na haswa mwimwi mosi kpwa kuadamira mbazi za Mlungu badala ya marifwa gehu ga hipha duniani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana tahukuandikirani mambo majeni isiphokala gago ambago munaweza kugasoma na kugaelewa. Hata ichikala hivi sambi tamuelewa chikamilifu, naamini kala siku mwenga mundaelewa vinono. Chisha siku Bwana Jesu achiuya, mundahenda ngulu na swiswi dza vyo hundivyokala na ngulu namwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.13+2CO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.13",
              "2CO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.13+2CO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.13",
              "2CO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira kala nina hakika na mambo higo, phahi nápanga kpwedza kpwenu kpwandza ili mphahe baraka kano mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.19.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 19:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nápanga kukutsupirani wakati naphiya Makedonia, na wakati nauya kula hiko, ili mphahe kuniterya wakati nchikala naphiya Judea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nriphopanga kukutsupirani siyakala na maazo ga kugaluza-galuza mipango yangu. Sipanga mipango yangu dza atu a dunia hino ambao hivi sambi anaweza kuamba “Ndivyo,” na badaye aambe “Sivyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama Mlungu arivyo muaminifu, ujumbe wehu kpwenu tauyakala wa “Ndivyo” na “Sivyo,” ela ni wa kuaminika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana Jesu Masihi, ambaye ni Mwana wa Mlungu, na ambaye mimi, Timothi na Sila hwamuhubiri kpwenu, siye wa “Ndivyo” na “Sivyo,” ela siku zosi iye ni wa “Ndivyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ahadi zosi ambazo Mlungu walaga ni za “Ndivyo” kpwa sababu ya arigohenda Jesu. Ndiyo naswi kpwa kuungana naye, hukuamba “Amina” ili Mlungu atogolwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu mwenye ndiye ahuphaye swiswi na mwimwi uwezo wa kudina chilume kpwa kuungana na Jesu. Iye ndiye ariyehutsambula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achihutiya mola kuonyesa kala hu akpwe, na achitiya Rohowe mwehu mioyoni dza mzamana kuhakikishirwa gara ndigokpwedza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
